  - Conversion to ONNX / int8 quantization: ALittleLov (dsh-soundcheck)
  - Converter repository: https://github.com/ALittleLov/dsh-soundcheck
  - Modifications: the model weights were converted from the original
    TensorFlow checkpoint to ONNX and quantized to int8. The file
    provided here (models/nmp.onnx, ~225 KB) is that derivative.

